# EPD105 physical side buttons, confirmed by getevent on sunxi-gpadc0.
# Plain volume keys (2026-09-24). Page turning is left to the reading apps' own settings:
# Kindle "Turn pages with volume controls", KOReader's volume-key page turning. A system-wide
# remap to D-pad/Space (used until 2026-09-24) paged in some apps but broke volume everywhere.
key 115   VOLUME_UP
key 114   VOLUME_DOWN
